==Battleground==
*1 [[Gabriel]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, with a delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Angelic Sleipnir]]s spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, with a delay 56.67~60 seconds<sup>1,700f~1,800f</sup>.
*6 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, with a delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If your [[Can Can Cat]] is at a high enough level, you can rush this entire stage. If it isn't, just spam [[Ramen Cat]] and Can Can.

